The evaluation protocol in metrics.py and the annotation handling in
scenediff.py reimplement the definitions of scripts/evaluate_multiview.py
in https://github.com/yuqunw/scene_diff (commit
62dcbd285fcfe984bb3db55dc01bdcd1a0055714). No upstream code is copied; the
upstream license is reproduced because the behavior is matched on purpose.

